  "html": "<p>為幫助新生109級學長找尋工程學院院內指導教授</p>\n<p>109級導師鄧福宸教授，協同劉院長及施執行長邀請了院內各系所有意願指導的教授簡略說明各自研究專長領域及輕鬆交流認識☺️</p>\n<p>感謝所有出席的師長與學長們! 師生們相談甚歡!</p>\n<p>現場也有成功媒合，立即簽好幾份指導教授同意書!</p>\n<p>賀成交! 讚讚讚!🎉🎉🎉🎉</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/e1c8ea7a59-mczh-tw1920x700-large3851-715535225390.jpg\" width=\"933\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/4595672337-mczh-tw1920x700-large3852-897070825391.jpg\" width=\"933\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/0f832df52a-mczh-tw1920x700-large3853-719830825391.jpg\" width=\"933\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/ace5d7de18-mczh-tw1920x700-large3854-580444425391.jpg\" width=\"525\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/cbc9214b2a-mczh-tw1920x700-large3855-130093425391.jpg\" width=\"525\"></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" height=\"700\" src=\"/legacy/img/94a6e03210-mczh-tw1920x700-large3856-827098525391.jpg\" width=\"933\"></figure>",
